<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,794 packages of landed tea sold at this week's London sale was 113.29 pence a kilo against 116.62 last week and 103.41 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 107,640 pkgs sold so far this year is 128.44 pence against 112.74 pence for the 146,306 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
